  "notes": "USAGE: {変更|へんこう} implies a deliberate, intentional change, often to plans, rules, or arrangements.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{変更|へんこう}する (to change/modify)\n・{変更|へんこう}を{加|くわ}える (to make changes)\n・{変更|へんこう}{点|てん} (change points)\n・{変更|へんこう}{届|とどけ} (change notification form)\n\nCONTRAST WITH {変化|へんか}:\n・{変化|へんか} - general change (can be natural or spontaneous)\n・{変更|へんこう} - deliberate modification (intentional action)",
